event: thinking
data: {"id": "30cb843615ad4fb8-thinking-parallel_evidence-683", "run_id": "30cb843615ad4fb8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口说明如下：\n\n**1. 核心事实：Pod 处于持续的 CrashLoopBackOff 状态**\n*   **生命周期状态**：Pod `workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` 当前 `phase: Running`，但 `Ready` 和 `ContainersReady` 状态为 `False`，原因是应用容器 `app` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n*   **重启证据**：Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 显示重启次数为 **18** 次；`kubectl_events` 记录了 310 次以上的 `BackOff` 警告，持续时间长达 73 分钟。\n*   **退出码**：容器状态明确记录了 `exitCode=78`，这通常对应应用层明确抛出的异常退出（如配置缺失或参数校验失败），而非 OOMKilled（通常是 137）或信号退出。\n\n**2. 根因定位：应用程序启动失败（应用层 Crash）**\n*   **日志证据**：`kubectl_", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789076701198, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "30cb843615ad4fb8-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "30cb843615ad4fb8", "seq": 684, "ts_ms": 1789076708115, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 83.591, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-07", "name": "workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/30cb843615ad4fb8-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "cc2db45b70f6cef1ebbc923a22f20ea7ac58cabc7b93a510f4f2b00f3f4d9c31", "bytes": 2450}, "snapshot_sha256": "0afcb707b52e8f93368ab8a82b9d49a8468f731009d3a9115ce880da8c702ff8"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "30cb843615ad4fb8-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "30cb843615ad4fb8", "seq": 685, "ts_ms": 1789076708116, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "30cb843615ad4fb8-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "30cb843615ad4fb8", "seq": 686, "ts_ms": 1789076719563, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 11.447, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2131, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Application startup failure due to missing configuration (CONFIG_MISSING) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod phase: Running; container.app waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff; container.app exit_code: 78 | 确认 Pod 运行但容器处于启动失败循环状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.app last_terminated_reason: Error; event.message: BackOff restarting failed container app (x310 over 73m) | 证实容器异常退出并持续重启的行为模式 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | event.message: k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks-status: | 记录 Pod 正常的网络状态与 CNI 信息 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | pattern: event=http_request, level=error, message=CONFIG_MISSING, http_status=500, path=/work | 直接指出应用启动阶段因 CONFIG_MISSING 导致 500 错误 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Tempo | span.name: GET /work; trace_id: 78c5df7615a0195018d603083f8c6f4b; span attributes: http.response.status_code=500, aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit | 链路跨度记录并印证了请求路由至 /work 时触发配置缺失导致的退出 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1 (reason: CrashLoopBackOff); kube_pod_status_phase = 1 (Running) | 监控指标确认 Pod 处于正常运行但容器持续等待的状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. K8s 状态（#1, #2）与 Metric 指标（#6）高度一致，共同描绘了 Pod 正常调度运行但容器因异常退出而陷入重启循环的现象。\n2. 日志（#4）直接给出了业务层面的异常模式（`CONFIG_MISSING`，500 错误），与 K8s 的 `exit_code: 78` 异常退出状态对应，解释了容器被 Kubelet 终止（`terminated_reason: Error`）的业务原因。\n3. 链路数据（#5）通过 `aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit` 和 `status_code=500` 提供了更底层的追踪视角，证实了应用处理 `/work` 请求时因配置缺失而终止的机制，且其 `trace_id` 与日志聚合关联，进一步确证了崩溃的直接诱因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n应用缺少必需配置 (CONFIG_MISSING) → 容器启动进程启动业务逻辑失败并终止 (exit_code 78) → kubelet 检测到容器异常退出触发重启与 BackOff 策略 → Pod 处于 Running 但容器持续 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认根因：应用启动失败（Application startup failure due to missing configuration）**\n证据表明，Pod 内的 `app` 容器在启动过程中因缺少关键配置（`CONFIG_MISSING`）导致进程异常退出（退出码 78，状态码 500）。这直接触发了 Kubernetes 的重启机制，进而陷入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 循环。K8s 事件、日志错误模式（`CONFIG_MISSING`）与应用层链路追踪（`aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit`）三者互相印证，提供了确凿的故障根因事实。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Application startup failure due to missing configuration (CONFIG_MISSING) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod phase: Running; container.app waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff; container.app exit_code: 78 | 确认 Pod 运行但容器处于启动失败循环状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.app last_terminated_reason: Error; event.message: BackOff restarting failed container app (x310 over 73m) | 证实容器异常退出并持续重启的行为模式 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | event.message: k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks-status: | 记录 Pod 正常的网络状态与 CNI 信息 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | pattern: event=http_request, level=error, message=CONFIG_MISSING, http_status=500, path=/work | 直接指出应用启动阶段因 CONFIG_MISSING 导致 500 错误 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Tempo | span.name: GET /work; trace_id: 78c5df7615a0195018d603083f8c6f4b; span attributes: http.response.status_code=500, aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit | 链路跨度记录并印证了请求路由至 /work 时触发配置缺失导致的退出 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1 (reason: CrashLoopBackOff); kube_pod_status_phase = 1 (Running) | 监控指标确认 Pod 处于正常运行但容器持续等待的状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. K8s 状态（#1, #2）与 Metric 指标（#6）高度一致，共同描绘了 Pod 正常调度运行但容器因异常退出而陷入重启循环的现象。\n2. 日志（#4）直接给出了业务层面的异常模式（`CONFIG_MISSING`，500 错误），与 K8s 的 `exit_code: 78` 异常退出状态对应，解释了容器被 Kubelet 终止（`terminated_reason: Error`）的业务原因。\n3. 链路数据（#5）通过 `aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit` 和 `status_code=500` 提供了更底层的追踪视角，证实了应用处理 `/work` 请求时因配置缺失而终止的机制，且其 `trace_id` 与日志聚合关联，进一步确证了崩溃的直接诱因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n应用缺少必需配置 (CONFIG_MISSING) → 容器启动进程启动业务逻辑失败并终止 (exit_code 78) → kubelet 检测到容器异常退出触发重启与 BackOff 策略 → Pod 处于 Running 但容器持续 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认根因：应用启动失败（Application startup failure due to missing configuration）**\n证据表明，Pod 内的 `app` 容器在启动过程中因缺少关键配置（`CONFIG_MISSING`）导致进程异常退出（退出码 78，状态码 500）。这直接触发了 Kubernetes 的重启机制，进而陷入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 循环。K8s 事件、日志错误模式（`CONFIG_MISSING`）与应用层链路追踪（`aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit`）三者互相印证，提供了确凿的故障根因事实。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

