认根因：应用启动失败（Application startup failure due to missing configuration）**\n证据表明，Pod 内的 `app` 容器在启动过程中因缺少关键配置（`CONFIG_MISSING`）导致进程异常退出（退出码 78，状态码 500）。这直接触发了 Kubernetes 的重启机制，进而陷入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 循环。K8s 事件、日志错误模式（`CONFIG_MISSING`）与应用层链路追踪（`aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit`）三者互相印证，提供了确凿的故障根因事实。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 13.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 83.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 83.6s (Evidence 76.8s, RCA 6.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 108.574, "metrics": {"run_id": "30cb843615ad4fb8", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 108.5806074142456, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "d